[0.533, "o", "don't know how to enumerate ttys on this system.\r\n! I you know how the serial ports are named send this information to\r\n! the author of this module:\r\n\r\nsys.platform = 'android'\r\nos.name = 'posix'\r\npySerial version = 3.5\r\n\r\nalso add the naming scheme of the serial ports and with a bit luck you can get\r\nthis module running...\r\n\u001b[1;31mThe installed version (3.5) of pySerial appears to be too old for esptool (Python interpreter /data/data/com.termux/files/usr/bin/python). Check the documentation for installation instructions.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
